    "created_at": "2024-02-16T18:34:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-02-16T18:34:46Z",
    "body": "> The problem is that for example removeNamedItem may return an Attr for the remove attribute even though some code run while the method was being executed an added another attribute with same name.\r\n\r\nIs this the case that you're describing?\r\n```html\r\n<div popover=auto id=mypopover>popover</div>\r\n<script>\r\nmypopover.showPopover();\r\nmypopover.addEventListener('beforetoggle', () => mypopover.setAttribute('popover', 'auto'));\r\nmypopover.removeAttribute('popover');\r\n</script>\r\n```",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
